[1011.682872, "o", "[SEARCH] 搜索结果: 共找到 1 处匹配，分布在 1 个文件中\r\n================================================================================\r\n\\n[FILE] mdftypes.h (1 处匹配)\\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n    [上下文]\\n     181 | \\n     182 | //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////\\n     183 | /// \\brief A single Mesh Object\\n     184 | /// \\author Ivgeni Segal\\n     185 | /// \\date January 20, 2007\\n     186 | ///\\n     187 | /// \\remarks The nDataOffset elements are the positions\\n     188 | /// relative to the beginning of the MDF file.\\n     189 | /// once the file is loaded they are converted into memory locations.\\n     190 | /// \\par\\n     191 | /// The TMdfMesh Object contains all the information needed to display a mesh\\n     192 | /// In addition to vertex information, the Mesh Object stores optional\\n     193 | /// bind-pose matrix array for animation as well as parenting information\\n     194 | /// for the joints. All joints are stored in depth-first order of the joint hierarchy.\\n     195 | /// \\par\\n     196 | /// Both of the arrays are parallel to the joint-keyframe\\n     197 | /// arrays in the the TMdfAnimation Object that corresponds to this mesh.\\n     198 | ///\\n     199 | ///\\n     200 | //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////\r\n>>>  201 | struct TMdfMesh\r\n     202 | {\\n     203 | \tunsigned int\tnNumVerts;\t\t///< Number of vertices in this mesh\\n     204 | \tunsigned int\tnNumIndices;\t///< Number of vertex indexes\\n     205 | \tunsigned int\tnNumJoints;\t\t///< Number of joints in stored bind\\n     206 | \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t///< pose and parenting arrays\\n     207 | \tMdfHandle\t\thTexture;\t\t///< Index of the texture name\\n     208 | \tint meshType;\t\t\t\t\t///< Mesh type (See MeshType enum)\\n     209 | \\n     210 | \t///\\n     211 | \t/// Mesh vertex array\\n     212 | \t///\\n     213 | \tunion UVerts_t {\t// reference to the vertices\\n     214 | \t\tvoid *pVertices;\t\t\t///< Vertexes when in memory\\n     215 | \t\tint nDataOffset;\t\t\t///< Offset to vertexes when in file\\n     216 | \t} uVtxs;\\n     217 | \\n     218 | \t///\\n     219 | \t/// Mesh index array\\n     220 | \t///\\n     221 | \tunion UIdxs_t {\r\n\\n================================================================================\r\n[DONE] 搜索完成: 1 处匹配，1 个文件，共搜索 1 个文件\r\n"]
